entries[383767] = { ["name"] = "Darkmoon Deck Box: Rime", ["text"] = "5 sec cast 3\nReagents:\nDarkmoon Deck: Rime , Awakened Frost (10), Writhebark (10), Cosmic Ink (12), Spark (#247)\nOptional Reagents:\nInfuse with Power (#111) , Illustrious Insight (#93) , Darkmoon Sigil (#202) , Blotting Sand (#221)\nSpecialization:\nArchiving - Frost\n\nDarkmoon Deck Box: Rime\nBinds when picked up\nUnique-Equipped: Darkmoon Deck (1)Trinket\n+244 [Agility or Strength or Intellect] Equip: Equip: Periodically shuffle the deck while in combat.\nUse: Use: Deal 10372 Frost damage and apply Awakening Rime to your target for 4-12s. If the target dies while Awakening Rime is active, it explodes for 25929 Frost damage split between enemies in a 10 yard radius. Duration is determined by the top-most card of the deck. (1 Min, 30 Sec Cooldown)" }
